  "text": "Low Effort Ghrazi Blood Knights (NM)\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nMelee Low Effort Method (19+ kph) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nItems\n⬥ Masterwork 2H Sword \n⬥ Nodon Spike Harness \nAbilities\n⬥ Darkness \n⬥ Chaos Roar \n⬥ Greater Fury \n⬥ Greater Bone Shield \nOther\n⬥ Pray  and \n    •  has not been tested and may not work\n⬥  Boon of Het and Totem of Vitality  required.\n⬥ Teleporting to War's Retreat  after every kill to replenish prayer, adrenaline, familiar and player health, and reset cooldowns.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Melee preset \n​\nAction Bar\n\n​\nThe fight\n⬥ Rejoin instance → (Master Magic cape)  →  →  → \n​\nPhase 3\n⬥ Target and kill all 6 Sanguine tumours in order to teleport\n⬥ Target and kill the Sanguine heart\n​\nPhase 4\n⬥ Move away from Lord Ghrazi or your damage dealt will be tanked by his proximity to Lady Ghrazi\n⬥ Target Lady Ghrazi\n​\nOptional Inputs\n​\n⬥ There is a very small chance of failure, which can be reduced with the following optional inputs\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Use  +  on P4 start\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Melee Low Effort \n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "Low Effort Ghrazi Blood Knights (NM) ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Melee Low Effort Method (19+ kph) Overview ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Items ⬥ Masterwork 2H Sword ⬥ Nodon Spike Harness Abilities ⬥ Darkness ⬥ Chaos Roar ⬥ Greater Fury ⬥ Greater Bone Shield Other ⬥ Pray and • has not been tested and may not work ⬥ Boon of Het and Totem of Vitality required. ⬥ Teleporting to War's Retreat after every kill to replenish prayer, adrenaline, familiar and player health, and reset cooldowns. ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Melee preset ​ Action Bar ​ The fight ⬥ Rejoin instance → (Master Magic cape) → → → ​ Phase 3 ⬥ Target and kill all 6 Sanguine tumours in order to teleport ⬥ Target and kill the Sanguine heart ​ Phase 4 ⬥ Move away from Lord Ghrazi or your damage dealt will be tanked by his proximity to Lady Ghrazi ⬥ Target Lady Ghrazi ​ Optional Inputs ​ ⬥ There is a very small chance of failure, which can be reduced with the following optional inputs ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Use + on P4 start ​ Example Kills ⬥ Melee Low Effort ​",
